(former times an Albanian or Epirote village. Fire destroyed it, and) Tj T*
(the fury of men has left it only a charred waste. A dizzy silence) Tj T*
(comes from these mountains. It falls and rolls over the blue water, so) Tj T*
(hard a blue one thinks a hammer might strike sparks from it. No one) Tj T*
(lives in these somber regions. Along the bays and inlets barks with) Tj T*
