() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                                  _Ionian Sea, 5 March._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Spring is venturing her first caresses. I know countrysides in) Tj T*
(France where the cherry trees are already blooming, where violets are) Tj T*
(fragrant, and lilacs are beginning to unfold. The April sun will soon) Tj T*
