(                                               25 April to 1 May, 1915._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The cruisers on the Ionian Sea have received orders to go up as far as) Tj T*
(the Strait of Otranto. Perhaps the Commander-in-Chief, who is stationed) Tj T*
(towards the south of Greece, has learned that the Austrians are) Tj T*
